+          <li pn="section-2.3-1.17">Added a clarification that Appendix C is normative.</li>
+          <li pn="section-2.3-1.18">Added a normative requirement on <xref target="RFC7146" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC7146"/> and made a few related
