+that of <xref target="RFC7146" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC7146"/>.</li>
+          <li pn="section-2.3-1.19">Added a new Section 9.2.3 covering Kerberos authentication
+considerations.</li>
+          <li pn="section-2.3-1.20">Added text in Section 9.3.3 noting that OCSP is now allowed for
