-IKE authentication with group pre-shared cryptographic keys <bcp14>SHOULD
-NOT</bcp14> be used unless it is not essential to protect group members
+IKE authentication with group pre-shared cryptographic keys <bcp14>SHOULD NOT</bcp14>
+be used unless it is not essential to protect group members
 against off-line dictionary attacks by other members.</t>
